jor buy or sell order without checking the official daily rate released by the All Sindh Saraf Jewellers Association.</li></ul><h3>Conclusion</h3><p>While mutual funds and real estate require significant capital, gold remains accessible. Buying even a few grams every month (committee style) is one of the smartest financial habits a Pakistani citizen can develop in 2026.</p>'
